      "tree": {
        "sha": "f2feec92a83fbc456f1cf28cbc33b5136cbce584",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/f2feec92a83fbc456f1cf28cbc33b5136cbce584"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree f2feec92a83fbc456f1cf28cbc33b5136cbce584\nparent 4b0b0fdb3db22b8be5f623b50ed26a701ee2f992\nauthor xyzconstant <263061129+xyzconstant@users.noreply.github.com> 1787805096 -0300\ncommitter xyzconstant <263061129+xyzconstant@users.noreply.github.com> 1787806553 -0300\n\nmining: replace interruptX methods with cancellation arguments\n\nAdd an optional `CancelArg` parameter to the blocking Mining methods\n`waitTipChanged`, `createNewBlock` and `waitNext`, and deprecate `interrupt()`\nand `interruptWait()`. The methods pass a CancelFn to the argument, which\nregisters it to run if the call is canceled.\n\nIn capnp schema, use the `Proxy.extraParam` annotation for the C++ `CancelArg`\nparameter and the `Cxx.allowCancellation` annotation to enable request\ncancels at the RPC layer.\n\nUpdate miner_tests to cancel `waitNext()` from another thread, and\ninterface_ipc_mining.py to drop the response promise and check the node\nlogs the cancellation. Also add `drop_promise()` to ipc_util.py to\nabandon capnp promises.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQHPBAABCAA5FiEEIbDHlvdH8seWa3oA61Yt6Z9Cs9EFAmqPw1kbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEOtWLemfQrPRQ+kMAIbi0u/G5JP1XSLvOod4\nakCSoLd2Upgvh86/vtQ4Aw9eh7HsIqKGbHPjJmU200sTACF8oWv5w2fBGId2xxPS\nUa/AD/qmkYyCqjvtzog6Q13YqHB2po/INvLKC6W9cMaHEQtuSx9jTmy+4dh/6BfM\nwHMmI0j1w1eBB+KkdNzeyY9Ob7TZKe0p42OMWxXQWPqqhO2fk1sA/TpTOwOi6LfO\nbeJ+ivCTpbPP/H3/Bd+c3V6Z94pXgjXksOswqji9PN6EgeAYF1sBPG8HIWojCqLN\nWl+gldJFtf8aK4FU15GbwkN8E/QPXTs4K2i8DLf69XRK2g+e8UQhGTZ56a6cvNCa\nI8yxUjezqMYBeqEVr6hveDOGrZt4cJHTLxUAQTGk1ssLvCd+M4AFszkMVhAQGZGn\n8yoplU5TpcEai3msXGbo7/I7wzsDirIYtWlo2Z0ZDhf2ycVwjOFIjNPh3RdDSWMH\n20KxyIv7v7uXfYBxYnrdgApC4sJkWCYTWvQ8jnY65GMLtQ==\n=8rzg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
